16
00:00:22,897 --> 00:00:24,399
Let's solve it together.

17
00:00:25,316 --> 00:00:26,818
Yuna.

18
00:00:28,028 --> 00:00:29,320
How about we make a bet?

19
00:00:29,946 --> 00:00:30,946
